{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "f9564c4dc4da02bcc084b9e3bd56b733f1aba9a78fb36aea34cc74ca3636ce81", "ja": "海外だと、キスが挨拶の国もあるし。\n言葉以外で気持ちを伝えるのも、大事だよね……。", "zh": "在国外，也有把亲吻当作问候的国家嘛。  \n用语言以外的方式传达心意，也很重要呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_intro_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "1f5517529c01d7c9c6632afac686b98a59e77f9eca32cf0d4e1a21cc06e4ff5f", "ja": "エレナちゃんも、よくハグしてくれるし！\n……と思ったけど。やっぱりキスは恥ずかしいかも？", "zh": "艾莲娜也经常抱我呢！\n……虽然我是这么想的。但果然，亲吻还是有点害羞吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_intro_1002_p", "source_sha256": "b4555efb3005ff9820a9d5937b5b277062e8647d38068ab1b4a744c70c658820", "ja": "キスがどうかしたんですか、青羽さん？", "zh": "亲吻怎么了吗，青羽小姐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "70c6886959bb4241bb9f78b2eb389c4988fcf71c1b02b4002c8d0295f996a156", "ja": "ひゃあ！？　{$P$}さん！\nい、今の話、聞いて……。", "zh": "呀！？　{$P$}先生！\n刚、刚才的话，你都听到了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_intro_1004_p", "source_sha256": "378696c47b48031a5aa8a847163f075262ded12c21d22dddeb95e8e8f43b1b7c", "ja": "すみません。声をかけようとしたら、聞こえてきて。\nでも、新鮮だと甘みがあっていいですよね。", "zh": "对不起。我正想跟您搭话，就听到了。\n不过，新鲜的吃起来带点甜味，确实很不错呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "b6029d9d199098f120fd95f8fba6aa34235f5a0dc015c667d334afb49e57df16", "ja": "し、新鮮……甘み！　なんだか大人な感想……。", "zh": "新、新鲜……甘甜！总觉得是很成熟的感想……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "e9eaafc62a1acf9e91f2c2a686c0dd993e579424e1bbd8f52dd603210915cbd3", "ja": "ちなみに{$P$}さんは、その、\nどんな経験が……？", "zh": "顺便问一下，{$P$}先生那个……  \n有过什么样的经历……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_intro_1007_p", "source_sha256": "7dae9758dcb84b24b7a3dfee09d0e0469bb66279ab7689c349959aca7cb04504", "ja": "経験？　そうですね……定番ですけど、\n天ぷらが一番かな。お刺身にしても美味しいですよね。", "zh": "经验？嗯……虽然是老生常谈，不过还是天妇罗最好。做成刺身也很好吃，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_intro_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "36492750bb19ec8be0bccc0e23621d9c0b42d654f1136e09be36d9545504d8b3", "ja": "天ぷら？　お刺身？\nあの、それって、もしかして……。", "zh": "天妇罗？生鱼片？\n那个，难道是指……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_intro_1009_p", "source_sha256": "f7eb774cc281dfeb66c2dc6ee605be94dc42830ab66202956e8bdb6aad5b48b2", "ja": "魚の、キスを使ったメニューですよね？\nあれ、違いましたか？", "zh": "是用鱼吻鱼做的菜吧？啊，难道不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_intro_1010_102mis", "source_sha256": "b5eb9ee0c250ee22ee7cb55dadc49f479f1bda5379ab04faac8787139fc08897", "ja": "い、いいえ！　そうなんです！\n夕ご飯、何にしようかなって考えてて……あはははっ。", "zh": "没、没有！就是这样！\n我只是在想要做些什么晚饭……啊哈哈哈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_intro_1011_102mis", "source_sha256": "c103b35966dd1a70b9a99370e9a8a338f72d5b00425f9fec8cf75c90484983a2", "ja": "あーっ！　そんなことより、社長さんが、\n{$P$}さんのことお呼びでしたよ！", "zh": "啊！比起那个，社长\n找{$P$}先生您过去呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_intro_1012_p", "source_sha256": "9d421e752f2674c17f479c81eba5e4d84c4db1245699da9cfb5071625595e08b", "ja": "社長が？　ありがとうございます。\nすぐに事務所に行ってみます！", "zh": "社长找我？谢谢您告诉我。\n我马上去事务所！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_intro_1013_102mis", "source_sha256": "c813a65644057340516ee56b1271eadb4d43e7225db8b3f623fe065810402aaf", "ja": "はい、行ってらっしゃーい♪\nなんかお腹空いちゃったな。今夜は魚料理にしよっと。", "zh": "好的，路上小心哦♪\n肚子好像有点饿了。今晚就做鱼料理吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_intro_1014_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_intro_1015_p", "source_sha256": "8312a250a30f9bed2b7f5a9e8f22f5a4a3256e72936f5b0f1388f155aec0f353", "ja": "お疲れさまです、音無さん、社長！\nお呼びだと伺いましたが。", "zh": "辛苦了，音无小姐、社长！听说您叫我过来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_intro_1016_president", "source_sha256": "e70ea44bfacc7c1b99c61dbbaf14a8a2ac3b9b5cc98772c7cdbdfefb2c2e4676", "ja": "おお～、よく来たね！\n君が来るのを待っていたんだ！", "zh": "哦～来得正好！\n我一直在等你来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_intro_1017_president", "source_sha256": "c7f0cc28741734baf387d9e6b9f53339b63badebbe508c1588191d8ccd50500d", "ja": "実は、知り合いから新曲のデモと歌詞をもらってね。\nそれが、実に素晴らしい曲なんだよ！", "zh": "其实，我从熟人那里拿到了新歌的Demo和歌词。\n那真是一首非常出色的曲子啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_intro_1018_101kot", "source_sha256": "09371ecc513a6c6022cab50b4f82bdee2fe4e9125b39b4c9f421d77493491002", "ja": "ふふっ、社長。\nお話の続きは、曲を聴いてからにしませんか？", "zh": "呵呵，社长。\n要不听完这首歌，再继续聊刚才的话题？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_intro_1019_president", "source_sha256": "afc4bab9a3b557379657c1ec5e97df8395c4d0132534b6a2cdfc772bb12f6318", "ja": "うむ、そうだった。\nまずは君にも聴いてもらおうかな……ポチッ。", "zh": "嗯，确实是这样。先让你也听听吧……按下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_intro_1021_p", "source_sha256": "7133f13fa4db71d9cc04b92f0c6e67a1344f7fd902313ec023e8b868865e95f8", "ja": "カ、カッコいい……！\n歌詞も扇情的で、ちょっとドキドキしますね。", "zh": "好、好帅……！\n歌词也很煽情，让人有点心跳加速呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_intro_1022_101kot", "source_sha256": "70ab9cbf5dcf521b71a85d9a51602a0c30ce52f5933424f37a7a00b4b8084542", "ja": "そうなんです！　懐かしい感じの曲調に色っぽい歌詞！\n私もつい妄想……いえ、興奮しちゃいました！", "zh": "就是这样！怀旧风格的曲调配上性感撩人的歌词！\n我也不禁开始幻想……不，是兴奋起来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_intro_1023_president", "source_sha256": "f18127b481a8cb8e35520629109bfa63b24f02590c30ee8c5a2d5a6b7583e26f", "ja": "はっはっはっ！　ふたりの反応をみていると、\nやはりこういった楽曲は人気が高そうだね！", "zh": "哈哈哈！看两个人的反应，这类歌曲果然很受欢迎呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_intro_1024_president", "source_sha256": "2cc52a33ff29025aa414a8bd07dab243e6f81e6e11e12e45c8c0519129026d63", "ja": "そろそろ、次の天体公演の時期だしね。\n新曲を披露する場にはいいと思うんだが、どうだろう？", "zh": "毕竟也差不多到了下一次天体公演的时间。  \n我觉得那里很适合披露新歌，你觉得呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_intro_1025_p", "source_sha256": "f3c514c31b7bdf4cb57f0f33061dc6eb0c5ea473be702fbc25581c4de9ff6812", "ja": "はい！\n新しいユニットのお披露目の場には相応しいかと！", "zh": "是！\n我觉得这正适合作为新组合的亮相舞台！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_intro_1026_president", "source_sha256": "374f4d191f917b4ce9f6a2b65ff4ca677727e7da63119172c3d6af7eb96f23c8", "ja": "うむ。そこで君には、この曲にピッタリなユニットの\nプロデュースと、公演の準備を進めてもらいたい。", "zh": "嗯。所以我想请你负责制作\n适合这首曲子的组合，并推进公演的筹备工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_intro_1027_101kot", "source_sha256": "4ac1dadd6694573c1d3e7f1985ccc6255d7dd081e00491b1baa81f15f4d32908", "ja": "わあ～！　誰が歌うのか、気になっちゃいますね。\n大人が歌うのも、もちろん素敵ですけど……。", "zh": "哇～！真让人好奇会由谁来唱呢。\n大人们来唱固然也很棒，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_intro_1028_101kot", "source_sha256": "e93cfbdfc10277e59276fe4e22e0e94109968705dd466029f8221d435715a2b2", "ja": "環ちゃん達の『TIntMe!』も、素敵でしたよね！\n可愛い3人なのに、楽曲に意外性があって……。", "zh": "环她们演唱的《TIntMe!》也很棒呢！\n明明是可爱的3个人，歌曲却充满了意外感……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_intro_1029_p", "source_sha256": "62136364f59e5734c6a2f53123ed9224e649fadb72e9980f07f615a90b66633d", "ja": "なるほど……。普段、あまりこういう曲を\n歌いそうにないアイドルというのもいいですね！", "zh": "原来如此……让平时不太会唱这种歌曲的偶像来演唱，也很不错呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_intro_1030_president", "source_sha256": "44cc284ef53af9a17a9a837fe0d4f7464966e6c696b13e3854a0f5f061b3cabf", "ja": "うむ！　意表を突く斬新なプロデュース、\n期待しているよ！", "zh": "嗯！我很期待你那出人意料、\n独具匠心的制作表现哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_intro_1031_p", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0187_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0187_story_intro_1032_p", "source_sha256": "af7983296b5101c78701d9a23cd433ec9de444efc0730b58aa2a42310fa92ff2", "ja": "（意外性か……うん、何となくイメージが\n固まってきたぞ。早速、みんなに集まってもらおう！）", "zh": "（意外性吗……嗯，总觉得已经渐渐有头绪了。马上把大家都叫来吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
